<view class="page form-page"><view class="title">相处之后，你怎么看它？</view><view class="mini-item"><view class="mini-art"><art src="{{item.photo}}" kind="{{item.art}}"/></view><view><view class="inline-name">{{item.name}}</view><view class="small muted">{{item.dayText}}</view></view></view><view class="review-block"><view class="section-title">它有哪些优点？</view><view class="chips"><view wx:for="{{pros}}" wx:key="name" class="chip {{item.selected?'selected':''}}" bindtap="toggle" data-kind="pros" data-name="{{item.name}}">{{item.name}}</view></view><button class="link" bindtap="custom" data-kind="pros">＋ 自定义</button></view><view class="rule"/><view class="review-block"><view class="section-title">它有哪些缺点？</view><view class="chips"><view wx:for="{{cons}}" wx:key="name" class="chip {{item.selected?'selected':''}}" bindtap="toggle" data-kind="cons" data-name="{{item.name}}">{{item.name}}</view></view><button class="link" bindtap="custom" data-kind="cons">＋ 自定义</button></view><view class="rule"/><view class="review-block"><view class="section-title">如果重新选择一次，<view class="line-break"/>你还会买它吗？</view><view class="chips"><view wx:for="{{choices}}" wx:key="*this" class="chip {{form.again===item?'selected':''}}" bindtap="again" data-value="{{item}}">{{item}}</view></view></view><view class="field"><text class="label">还有什么想说的？</text><view class="control"><textarea maxlength="3000" value="{{form.note}}" placeholder="选填，以后随时可以改变看法。" bindinput="input" data-key="note"/></view></view><view class="actions"><button class="secondary" bindtap="cancel">取消</button><button class="primary" bindtap="save">保存评价</button></view></view>
